WEBVTT

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:10.030
<i>When the throne of the king of beasts 
was left empty after King's haircut...</i>

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:10.480
<b>I hope you all go extinct!</b>

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:10.940
<b>Damn omnivore!!! 
I mean you!</b>

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:12.030
<b>I will rule over all mammals!!</b>

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:16.910
<i>The biggest territorial battle in 
Seton Academy's history broke out.</i>

00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:21.900
<i>Males bared their fangs at each 
other in their race to the top!</i>

00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:30.630
At least the herbivores are peaceful.

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:37.090
Hey! I'm basically your pet now!

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:39.760
You're the one who said you wanted 
to walk to school with me.

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:41.430
This isn't walking! It's taking me for a walk!

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:46.560
But you and I... are packmates.

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:49.440
Okay.

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:51.630
Then we'll walk to school together...

00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:53.970
over my dead body.

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:56.180
What?! Come on!

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:00.050
Hey! Quit running in circles around me!

00:01:00.050 --> 00:01:01.700
Stop, you i-idiot!

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:03.950
You're embarrassing me!

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:17.950
<b>Join the Pack!</b>

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:17.950
<b>Seton Academy</b>

00:01:38.930 --> 00:01:39.570
<b>Unnatural interspecies relations are strictly forbidden!!</b>

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:49.580
<b>Miyubi: Dead</b>

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:37.010
<b>Seton Academy Record 4      The Self-Styled Young Man and the Giant Wolf</b>

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:39.010
The hell?!

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:40.080
You wanna go?!

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:41.140
I'm gonna bite you!

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:42.640
<b>Cooking Room</b>

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:45.130
This has turned into quite a mess.

00:02:45.130 --> 00:02:45.850
Yeah.

00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:51.480
Wait, aren't you gonna get 
in on the territory war?

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:53.020
Nope!

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:55.460
My territory is wherever you are!

00:02:55.460 --> 00:02:57.110
I don't recall okaying that!

00:02:57.110 --> 00:03:00.030
This is a first, though, isn't it?

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:03.530
I've never heard of a conflict 
getting this wild at Seton Academy.

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:07.120
Usually when things get 
too crazy, the teachers step in.

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:10.530
Which must mean this isn't that big a deal.

00:03:10.530 --> 00:03:13.630
But it's actually a bit different this time!

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:15.700
In this territory war,

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:18.380
the animal that comes out on top

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:21.510
will be given a hundred years' 
worth of food, or so they say!

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:24.390
A... A hundred years?!

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:25.980
That's not all.

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:28.600
There are rumors that the 
winner might be able to do

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:30.990
whatever they want with this school.

00:03:30.990 --> 00:03:32.690
Is that really true?

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:35.730
Rumors are rumors. There's no
 credibility to them.

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:37.860
We can't say that for sure.

00:03:39.020 --> 00:03:43.050
There is... one rumor... that's concerning.

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:44.230
That's right!

00:03:44.230 --> 00:03:46.420
There's a student from another 
school who heard these rumors

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:48.370
and is coming after Seton Academy!

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:50.490
But that's just another rumor, right?

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:52.580
Could they be talking about...

00:03:52.930 --> 00:03:55.430
what's been going on with 
the buried carnivores?

00:03:55.430 --> 00:03:56.710
Huh? What's this, now?

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:57.960
In the area around campus,

00:03:57.960 --> 00:04:02.990
a bunch of carnivorous students have 
been found literally buried in walls.

00:04:02.990 --> 00:04:03.970
For real?

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:07.720
And they're being found closer 
and closer to this school!

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:07.720
<b>Seton Academy</b>

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:10.470
It's no longer... just a rumor.

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:12.690
That's right! This school

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:15.190
is a target!

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:17.900
Oh, no... I'm scared...

00:04:18.220 --> 00:04:20.100
It'll be fine, Hino-sa—

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:22.990
I'll protect the cooking club! 
I'm the boss, after all!

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:26.460
You couldn't even beat a 
bear. What're you gonna do?

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:28.740
W-Well, maybe I can't beat one right now,

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:32.120
but I'm gonna work hard and get 
strong like my big sister!

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:34.870
You have an older sister, Ranka-san?

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:37.990
Yeah! We're always together 
when I'm back home!

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:41.130
Wait, where do you come from, anyway?

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:45.550
Up north, where it can get as cold 
as twenty degrees below zero!

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:47.250
Twenty below?!

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:49.370
Don't your feet freeze?

00:04:49.370 --> 00:04:50.970
I did fine for some reason!

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:53.540
<i>Most animals that inhabit cold climates</i>

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:56.200
<i>have a countercurrent heat exchange system</i>

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:57.900
<i>that instantly warms up the blood in their feet</i>

00:04:57.900 --> 00:04:59.690
<i>when it's been chilled by the ground.</i>

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:03.530
Also, whenever I was cold, my sister...

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:07.450
would always let me wear her coat!

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:09.570
She seems like a really nice sister.

00:05:09.570 --> 00:05:10.340
Yeah!

00:05:11.570 --> 00:05:14.010
But before I came here,

00:05:14.010 --> 00:05:18.080
when I said I wanted to make friends 
with other animals and start my own pack,

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:19.980
we got into a fight.

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:22.230
And ever since then...

00:05:22.970 --> 00:05:26.510
Well, you did start a pack with 
other animals, just like you said you would.

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:27.830
So what's the problem?

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:29.720
Jin!

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:31.810
He really sucks at cheering people up.

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:32.720
Shut up!

00:05:33.090 --> 00:05:34.410
I wasn't cheering her up!

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:34.410
See?

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:34.980
Jin!

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:37.730
Is she there?

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:40.230
Yes. It's definitely Ranka-sama.

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:41.940
She seems very cheerful.

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:44.030
I see...

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:45.570
Are you going in?

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:46.630
No.

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:48.300
It's been such a long time...

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:52.430
What if she doesn't recognize 
me when she sees me?

00:05:52.430 --> 00:05:54.120
Oh, you have nothing to worry about there.

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.290
She'll know right away.

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:59.490
Actually, it hasn't been <i>that </i>
long since she left, has it?

00:05:59.490 --> 00:06:01.350
Since Ranka left home,

00:06:01.350 --> 00:06:04.470
the time passing by has felt like an eternity.

00:06:04.470 --> 00:06:06.980
But you can finally see her now.
Isn't that a good thing?

00:06:06.980 --> 00:06:08.230
Now, let's go!

00:06:08.230 --> 00:06:09.350
R-Right...

00:06:09.350 --> 00:06:10.510
Jin! Jin!

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:12.540
Cut it out, you dumb dog!

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:16.230
What is he doing to my sister?

00:06:16.230 --> 00:06:21.730
Anyone who is rude to my little sister will pay!

00:06:24.870 --> 00:06:26.110
Who are these guys?

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:29.100
She's huge!

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:34.990
Ranka-chan!

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:34.990
Ranka-san!

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:34.990
Dumb dog!

00:06:37.110 --> 00:06:40.600
I missed you, Ranka!

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:41.810
Onee-chan!

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:45.440
It's really you, Onee-chan!

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:46.980
It's been so long!

00:06:46.980 --> 00:06:49.800
<i>Whoa... They even do that 
with family members?</i>

00:06:50.900 --> 00:06:54.680
Sh-She looks awfully big 
to be Ranka-san's sister.

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:56.810
That's Bergmann's rule at work.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:59.020
<b>Hot</b>

00:06:56.810 --> 00:07:00.950
<i>Bergmann's rule states that the colder 
the climate an animal lives in,</i>

00:07:00.950 --> 00:07:04.310
<i>the larger it will grow in order 
to maintain its body heat.</i>

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:04.310
<b>Cold</b>

00:07:04.310 --> 00:07:07.530
If she let the dumb dog wear 
her coat on cold days,

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:09.530
that's probably why she grew bigger.

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:10.980
Wow...

00:07:17.390 --> 00:07:18.580
B-Boss?

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:20.410
What is the mat...

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:22.050
...ter?!

00:07:22.050 --> 00:07:24.440
I was always sensitive about my size,

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:27.030
but I can be proud of it from now on!

00:07:27.030 --> 00:07:28.840
<i>Being big bothered her that much?</i>

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:32.350
You are quite a promising chimpanzee!

00:07:32.350 --> 00:07:33.760
Who are you calling a chimpanzee?!

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:36.630
She goes to another school.

00:07:36.630 --> 00:07:38.130
Do you think...

00:07:38.130 --> 00:07:40.850
I-Is she here for the territory war?

00:07:41.430 --> 00:07:44.290
I have no interest in any territory war.

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:46.390
I came here for one reason.

00:07:48.170 --> 00:07:50.780
Leave Seton Academy and come back home, Ranka!

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:52.490
What? Why?

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:54.130
You are a wolf.

00:07:54.130 --> 00:07:57.320
Wolves can't live apart from their families.

00:07:57.320 --> 00:07:59.500
That's an order from 
your boss. We're going home.

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:04.250
As my younger sister, you will be 
part of my pack, as my right hand.

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:05.170
No!

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:07.040
What?

00:08:07.410 --> 00:08:08.960
I'm not going home!

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:11.780
You're defying an order from your boss?!

00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:14.090
I'm not a member of your pack!

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:17.620
I have a new pack that I started up with Jin!

00:08:17.620 --> 00:08:18.560
Leave me out of this.

00:08:18.880 --> 00:08:20.670
You're in a pack with that chimpanzee?!

00:08:20.670 --> 00:08:22.810
Excuse me?! I'm a human, you stupid wild dog!

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:24.470
What's the meaning of this, Ranka?!

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:27.900
Jin and I have exchanged the 
vows of husband and wife!

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:27.900
That never happened!

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:30.660
Husband and wife?!

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:32.590
How dare you?!

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:34.200
Talk about brute strength!

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:36.370
I'm sure Ranka objected, and you forced her!

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:37.910
Try the exact opposite!

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:39.460
Onee-chan, stop it!

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:42.080
Is this chimpanzee that important to you?

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:44.420
Yes, he is! So let him go!

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:46.480
Please, Onee-chan!

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:47.540
Very well, then.

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:55.380
You... will join my pack.

00:08:55.980 --> 00:08:56.900
Huh?

00:08:56.900 --> 00:09:00.260
It's necessary, since Ranka 
doesn't want to leave you.

00:09:00.590 --> 00:09:02.230
I never thought...

00:09:03.110 --> 00:09:06.350
I would befriend anyone who wasn't a wolf.

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:08.730
Wait a second... What are you about to do?!

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:10.060
Jin-kun!

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:12.140
Don't worry.

00:09:12.140 --> 00:09:14.700
To make sure you can join my pack, too...

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:16.660
I'll make you a male.

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:17.780
Jin-kun?!

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:21.660
Stop!

00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:25.200
Even if you are my big sister,

00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:27.920
if you do anything else to 
Jin or my other friends...

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:30.420
I'll never forgive you!

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:32.920
Never forgive me, you say?

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:39.100
<i>In a wolf pack, the hierarchy is absolute.</i>

00:09:39.570 --> 00:09:42.640
<i>If a lower-ranked wolf defies 
a higher-ranked wolf,</i>

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:45.250
<i>even if they're immediate family,</i>

00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:47.020
<i>they will not get out of it unscathed.</i>

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:52.600
How dare you speak to your 
elder sister that way?!

00:09:52.600 --> 00:09:54.660
If you don't leave now...

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:57.820
I'll hate you forever!

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:00.950
<i>Are we back in grade school?!</i>

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:02.500
Boss, what shall we...

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:02.990
<i>do</i>?!

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:07.410
She hates me... She hates me... 
She hates me... She hates me... She hates me...

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:04.240
<b>Beeeeep</b>

00:10:05.350 --> 00:10:06.120
Boss!

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:07.410
Retreat!

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:08.670
And never come back!

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:10.300
Are you okay, Jin-kun?

00:10:10.300 --> 00:10:11.400
Yeah.

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:12.700
Onee-chan...

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:15.260
You finally got to see her 
again after so long...

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:19.010
That's how she acted when I left home, too.

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:21.570
I'm sure she'll understand.

00:10:21.570 --> 00:10:23.420
She's right, Ranka-chan.

00:10:23.420 --> 00:10:25.020
Thanks.

00:10:25.570 --> 00:10:27.470
<i>Seton Academy: Join the Pack!</i>

00:10:27.470 --> 00:10:30.020
<i>Eastern wolf!</i>

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:32.680
<i>Seton Academy: Join the Pack!</i>

00:10:32.680 --> 00:10:35.030
<i>Spotted hyena!</i>

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:42.410
<i>They still don't realize that they 
can't resolve anything with strength alone?</i>

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:48.410
Kin-kun, do you have a minute?

00:10:49.430 --> 00:10:49.920
What?!

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:52.170
Wh-What do you mean, Shiho-dono?!

00:10:52.530 --> 00:10:55.050
The new member in my club works really hard,

00:10:55.050 --> 00:10:56.670
and I can't let her beat me.

00:10:56.670 --> 00:10:58.640
But we could still see each other...

00:10:58.640 --> 00:11:02.140
I want to concentrate on practice, 
so I can't see you for a while.

00:11:02.540 --> 00:11:03.650
Kin-kun...

00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:05.540
I'm sorry!

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:07.560
Shiho-dono!

00:11:14.530 --> 00:11:16.360
Excellent work, boss.

00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:19.620
It seems Seton Academy did 
not live up to the rumors.

00:11:20.060 --> 00:11:21.610
Oh... Yeah.

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:26.370
<i>I guess hearing Ranka-sama say that 
must have come as quite a shock.</i>

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:27.870
Was it you guys?

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:30.870
Are you the ones who've been 
messing with our school turf?

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:33.580
They came after us first.

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:36.880
We have no intention of doing 
anything to Seton Academy.

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:39.090
I don't care about those jerks.

00:11:39.090 --> 00:11:41.380
I want to be the one on top at this school.

00:11:41.770 --> 00:11:44.390
If there's someone strong here, then...

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:46.850
I've gotta fight them!

00:11:47.620 --> 00:11:49.310
I wondered what sort of male you might be...

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:56.910
Morning, Jin!

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:00.040
Jin, let's lick each other!

00:12:00.040 --> 00:12:01.650
Stop it, you dumb dog!

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:03.370
Hide!

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:07.610
What was that all about?

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:12.410
Morning! Morning!

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:14.250
Was it that wolf?

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:17.340
Since you said not to come up 
and lick you out of nowhere,

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:19.980
I thought I could do it 
after saying hello to you.

00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:20.420
Well, don't!

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:23.680
Whether you say hello to me or not isn't the...

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:28.430
Wh-What do you want?

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:32.640
We heard you guys were the ones 
who sent that giant wolf packing.

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:34.020
And that means...

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:38.520
Beating you is the fastest 
way to get to the top!

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:41.140
Hang on! What gave you that idea?!

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:46.170
What a cute little growl!

00:12:46.170 --> 00:12:48.740
It just makes me wanna lunge at you!

00:12:56.950 --> 00:12:59.580
I don't like seeing people bully the weak.

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:02.730
Yena-kun, you're so cool!

00:13:02.730 --> 00:13:05.150
<i>This kid's a hyena?</i>

00:13:05.740 --> 00:13:09.350
Were you really the ones who 
ran off that giant wolf?

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:11.350
<i>The spotted hyena.</i>

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:13.830
<i>They're often depicted as stealing 
prey from other animals,</i>

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:18.180
<i>but they are excellent hunters with 
a higher success rate than lions.</i>

00:13:18.590 --> 00:13:23.190
<i>They are the only carnivores in the 
savanna that can beat a lion in a fight.</i>

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:26.420
<i>But of course, that's only 
when they attack as...</i>

00:13:26.940 --> 00:13:27.490
<i>a pack?!</i>

00:13:29.860 --> 00:13:33.080
What kind of male attacks 
from behind, huh?!

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:33.750
Seriously?

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:36.630
Yena-kun, you're the best!

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:39.160
Shut up, you females! Quit screeching!

00:13:39.160 --> 00:13:39.630
So...

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:45.330
You definitely don't look like people 
who could chase off that giant wolf.

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:47.750
Hey, human.

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:51.140
Doesn't being protected by a female 
make you feel like a loser?

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:53.390
This is what determines a male's—

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:54.520
You're female, though!

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:56.890
female, though!

00:13:57.260 --> 00:13:58.770
<i>H-He...</i>

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:00.770
<i>...said the one thing that's taboo to Yena-kun!</i>

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:02.610
Y-You little...

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:04.030
What makes you think I'm a female?!

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:05.270
Your looks.

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:07.490
<b>Male</b>

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:07.490
<b>Female</b>

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:10.200
This isn't good! That human might get killed!

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:13.410
Hmph.

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:15.270
I'd like to kill you,

00:14:15.270 --> 00:14:17.790
but I don't raise my hand against the weak.

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:19.180
I'm a real male, after all.

00:14:19.820 --> 00:14:21.860
Yena-kun!

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:22.970
She's female, right?

00:14:22.970 --> 00:14:23.900
Yep.

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:26.880
<b>Cooking Room</b>

00:14:30.670 --> 00:14:33.210
You have the sweet smell of a female.

00:14:33.210 --> 00:14:34.930
D-Do I?

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:38.210
Y-You stupid hyena!

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:39.600
What the hell do you want?!

00:14:39.950 --> 00:14:41.620
You're scaring our other club members!

00:14:41.620 --> 00:14:43.020
Get back to your own pack!

00:14:43.420 --> 00:14:45.420
I'm not part of any pack.

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:48.100
Besides, I don't pick on the weak.

00:14:48.100 --> 00:14:48.610
But...

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:51.990
Being called a female is the 
one thing I won't stand for!

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:53.260
You <i>are</i> female, though.

00:14:53.260 --> 00:14:54.740
I'm a male!

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:57.520
You know what? It doesn't 
even matter. Just leave.

00:14:57.520 --> 00:14:58.260
It does matter!

00:14:58.260 --> 00:15:00.750
I won't leave until you admit that I'm a male!

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:02.930
Oh, now that I look closer, you're male.

00:15:02.930 --> 00:15:03.860
Now go away.

00:15:03.860 --> 00:15:04.960
Are you making fun of me?!

00:15:05.730 --> 00:15:09.200
What is all this, anyway? 
A male playing house?

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:10.590
All a male needs to eat...

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:11.840
is this!

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:15.530
<i>Hyenas have exceptionally 
powerful jaws.</i>

00:15:15.530 --> 00:15:17.420
<i>They even eat the bones of their prey.</i>

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:23.560
<i>Their jaw strength ranks third among 
all land mammals, behind hippos and bears.</i>

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:27.140
Well? That looked pretty manly, right?

00:15:27.140 --> 00:15:29.810
Uh, no. A female hyena would 
eat bones like that, too.

00:15:29.810 --> 00:15:30.730
What?!

00:15:30.730 --> 00:15:31.950
Time to start cooking.

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:32.910
All right!

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:34.460
What shall we make?

00:15:34.460 --> 00:15:35.190
Meat!

00:15:35.190 --> 00:15:36.200
We're using vegetables this time.

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:37.920
Aw, I want meat!

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:38.410
Shut up!

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:42.200
Damn it... I tried to be nice, 
and you pushed your luck!

00:15:42.200 --> 00:15:46.000
If you get too mouthy with me, I'll squash you!

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:51.060
Oh, look what you made me do!

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:51.530
<b>* Koalas have a grip strength of one ton (but only in urban legends)</b>

00:15:51.060 --> 00:15:52.570
Well, that's faster than cutting it.

00:15:53.690 --> 00:15:56.140
If I can break this with my bare hands,
 you have to admit I'm a male!

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:57.100
Leave already.

00:15:57.100 --> 00:15:59.020
Just shut up and watch!

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:00.560
Hold this for me.

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:04.060
I came up with this technique 
to beat those lions.

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:05.330
I call it...

00:16:06.350 --> 00:16:09.150
Miyubi!

00:16:07.790 --> 00:16:09.150
<b>The Seton Academy Cooking Club Animal Murder Case!</b>

00:16:07.790 --> 00:16:09.150
<b>~ Sloth Crushed by Hyena's Roof Tile ~</b>

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:11.240
You killed Miyubi!

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:12.740
Huh?! Wait, no!

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:14.660
All I did was hand her the roof tile!

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:18.520
What were you saying about picking 
on the weak, you animal murderer?

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:20.650
I-I didn't! I never meant to—

00:16:20.650 --> 00:16:23.410
Your idea of what makes someone 
a male is old-fashioned, anyway.

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:26.880
He's right. Whether you're male or 
female doesn't matter nowadays.

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:30.450
Getting hung up on that is 
so unbefitting of a male.

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:37.390
I didn't want to get violent with you,

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:39.810
but after mocking me so much, 
you leave me no choice.

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:45.310
Hello?! Something terrible is happening!

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:48.240
President! There's a report 
from the observation team!

00:16:48.240 --> 00:16:51.460
A hyena is trying to start a 
fist fight in the cooking club!

00:16:51.460 --> 00:16:53.990
The territory war has reached that far?

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:57.590
Let's use this opportunity 
to crush the cooking club!

00:16:57.590 --> 00:17:00.180
No, wait! We owe a debt to them!

00:17:00.180 --> 00:17:01.450
That's a different matter!

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:02.840
No, it's not!

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:04.210
It is!

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:08.620
They may be perverts who want 
to start an interspecies harem,

00:17:08.620 --> 00:17:11.610
but we have a responsibility 
to protect all students!

00:17:11.360 --> 00:17:12.710
<b>Approval Rating
 99%</b>

00:17:12.710 --> 00:17:14.630
We've received video!

00:17:14.630 --> 00:17:16.510
Let's view it at once.

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:18.680
<i>Stop!</i>

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:19.300
<i>Shut up!</i>

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:21.460
<i>Just a second isn't gonna hurt!</i>

00:17:21.460 --> 00:17:22.860
<i>Yes, it will!</i>

00:17:28.010 --> 00:17:29.150
P-President!

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:32.150
The shock was too much for her! Stop the video!

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:35.560
Don't stop me! I'm trying to 
show you proof that I'm a male!

00:17:35.560 --> 00:17:37.130
Don't show me that!

00:17:37.130 --> 00:17:38.930
It's not like I want to do this!

00:17:38.930 --> 00:17:43.230
But after you made fun of 
my looks, I can't back down!

00:17:44.130 --> 00:17:46.160
You have a face like a female!

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:48.050
Female! Female!

00:17:48.050 --> 00:17:50.290
I'm a male!

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:52.600
The female's mad!

00:17:54.190 --> 00:17:56.170
What's wrong, Yena?

00:17:56.600 --> 00:17:59.100
Did the kids make fun of your clothes again?

00:17:59.100 --> 00:18:01.850
I'm sorry all we can give you are 
your brother's hand-me-downs.

00:18:03.070 --> 00:18:04.720
I hate my face.

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:07.860
I wish my face looked like yours.

00:18:10.460 --> 00:18:13.860
Yena, saying things like that 
will make your mom sad.

00:18:14.450 --> 00:18:18.130
Your face is the spitting 
image of your late mother's.

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:22.950
She was a strong hyena who 
could even beat a lion.

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:25.850
So I know you'll be strong, too.

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:30.820
This face is my link to my 
dead mother, and I'm proud of it!

00:18:30.820 --> 00:18:34.170
I won't cave on this!

00:18:34.170 --> 00:18:35.650
Wait, wait, wait!

00:18:35.650 --> 00:18:38.220
Showing me that isn't going to prove anything!

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:39.880
You won't know that until you see it!

00:18:39.880 --> 00:18:41.590
Okay, listen to me!

00:18:41.590 --> 00:18:43.300
With hyenas...

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:45.060
Even the females have one!

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:47.060
females have one!

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:48.560
females have one!

00:18:48.910 --> 00:18:50.660
females have one!

00:18:51.430 --> 00:18:52.060
Huh?

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:55.260
Female hyenas have a fake one of those!

00:18:55.260 --> 00:18:58.030
Even if you show it off, most people
 couldn't tell the difference!

00:18:58.030 --> 00:18:59.870
<i>A female spotted hyena's genitals</i>

00:18:58.030 --> 00:19:02.280
<b>Male</b>

00:18:58.030 --> 00:19:02.280
<b>Female</b>

00:18:59.870 --> 00:19:02.280
<i>grow to the point that they look like a male's.</i>

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:04.910
<b>Male</b>

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:04.910
<b>Female</b>

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:04.910
<b>S</b>

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:04.910
<b>S</b>

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:04.910
<i>It's difficult to tell them 
apart just by looking.</i>

00:19:05.260 --> 00:19:06.420
Really?

00:19:06.420 --> 00:19:08.510
Why didn't you already know that?!

00:19:08.510 --> 00:19:12.200
I mean, I've never seen a female hyena's body.

00:19:12.200 --> 00:19:14.420
Even at the public bath, 
I always got in with the males.

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:16.650
That means...

00:19:16.650 --> 00:19:19.650
Oh, Yena-chan! Want some 
of your cousin's clothes?

00:19:19.650 --> 00:19:21.700
I don't wear female clothes!

00:19:21.700 --> 00:19:23.380
Even though you're a girl?

00:19:24.430 --> 00:19:27.310
Yena, you can act more like a female.

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:28.650
You're a female, after all.

00:19:28.650 --> 00:19:29.930
But why?!

00:19:29.930 --> 00:19:33.220
Yena, aren't you going to wear the 
girls' uniform for your entrance ceremony?

00:19:33.220 --> 00:19:34.710
Like hell I am.

00:19:34.710 --> 00:19:37.720
I'm... a female?

00:19:37.720 --> 00:19:39.160
Poor girl.

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:40.450
She's way too dumb.

00:19:42.890 --> 00:19:45.330
It was just a little
misunderstanding, that's all.

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:47.080
It's okay!

00:19:48.820 --> 00:19:50.000
But, hey...

00:19:50.740 --> 00:19:53.170
It's great that you've cleared up your mistake!

00:19:56.630 --> 00:19:59.560
All lies!

00:19:59.560 --> 00:20:01.290
I kinda feel bad for her.

00:20:01.290 --> 00:20:04.210
Well, she was gonna have to find out someday.

00:20:04.210 --> 00:20:05.970
You think she'll be able to get over it?

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:06.890
No worries there.

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:08.930
She's tough.

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:11.140
I'm sure she'll find the answer herself.

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:14.650
You really are nice, Jin!

00:20:17.110 --> 00:20:20.100
I keep telling you not to do that!

00:20:20.100 --> 00:20:21.110
Kuromori...

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:21.820
Boss?

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:25.870
Ranka called those guys her pack, didn't she?

00:20:25.380 --> 00:20:25.870
Correct.

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:29.710
I thought she'd just be crying all by herself.

00:20:29.710 --> 00:20:33.350
But she really did find her own pack.

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:37.040
Enough already, you dumb dog!

00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:39.550
Still, that chimpanzee...

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:42.760
isn't right for Ranka at all!

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:46.260
Oh, it's Ranka-san's older sister.

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:48.510
Onee-chan, how long are you gonna hang around?

00:20:48.510 --> 00:20:50.770
I-I'm just looking out for you.

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:52.130
Well, don't! Go home!

00:20:52.130 --> 00:20:53.440
I won't be in the way!

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:53.930
No!

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:54.640
Just a little bit?

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:55.900
I said no!

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:58.330
Why?!

00:21:23.110 --> 00:21:24.610
<b>Awoooo</b>

00:21:24.990 --> 00:21:26.570
<b>Awoooo</b>

00:22:29.030 --> 00:22:32.030
What? You thought you were 
a male all this time?

00:22:32.030 --> 00:22:35.580
I thought you just wanted to 
be treated like a male...

00:22:35.580 --> 00:22:37.210
I was stupid.

00:22:37.210 --> 00:22:39.330
Now that I know I'm a female,

00:22:39.330 --> 00:22:42.040
I'm going to accept the truth 
like a good male should.

00:22:42.040 --> 00:22:43.170
R-Really?

00:22:43.610 --> 00:22:46.420
Actually, I thought this might happen someday.

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:50.800
Yena, that looks perfect on you!

00:22:50.800 --> 00:22:52.930
D-Dad...

00:22:52.930 --> 00:22:54.510
Dad! Yena is—

00:22:54.960 --> 00:22:56.010
Bro?!

00:22:56.630 --> 00:22:58.970
Th-This looks ridiculous, doesn't it?

00:22:58.970 --> 00:23:01.580
Don't worry, Yena! Leave everything to me!

00:23:01.580 --> 00:23:02.270
Huh?

00:23:02.270 --> 00:23:04.790
I thought this might happen someday,

00:23:04.790 --> 00:23:07.240
so I got a hair stylist's license!

00:23:07.440 --> 00:23:08.990
<b>1 Hour Later</b>

00:23:10.380 --> 00:23:11.360
This is...

00:23:11.360 --> 00:23:13.290
m-me?!

00:23:15.870 --> 00:23:18.000
I can't believe it!

00:23:17.170 --> 00:23:18.000
Yena?!

00:23:18.000 --> 00:23:20.520
I'm... I'm...

00:23:20.520 --> 00:23:24.450
a male!

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:26.020
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:26.020 --> 00:23:26.480
<b>Yena here.</b>

00:23:26.480 --> 00:23:27.900
<b>Apparently, I'm a female.</b>

00:23:27.900 --> 00:23:29.150
<b>Ferrill here.</b>

00:23:29.150 --> 00:23:30.110
<b>I still love Ranka as much as ever.</b>

00:23:30.110 --> 00:23:31.860
<b>Today's story was about aiming for the top of the school.</b>

00:23:31.860 --> 00:23:33.200
<b>Next week will be different: a story about aiming for the top of the school.</b>

00:23:33.200 --> 00:23:35.120
<b>That's exactly the same!</b>

00:23:35.120 --> 00:23:37.660
<b>Same or not, don't miss it, because Ranka will be in it.</b>

00:23:37.660 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Seton Academy Record 5</b>

00:23:37.660 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Who Was Brave?</b>
